G3R: Gaussian-Based Geometry-Guided Reconstruction for Fetal Brain MRI
Copyright 2026 Zhibao Cai, Yao Lv, Xin Zhang, and Chaoxiang Yang.

The Gaussian reconstruction implementation is based on Gaussian Primitives for Fast SVR
by the GSVR authors (https://github.com/m-dannecker/Gaussian-Primitives-for-Fast-SVR),
licensed under Apache License 2.0. The G3R release adds the learned structural prior
and the slice-wise registration interface.

The vendored NeSVoR/SVoRT inference components are based on NeSVoR by Junshen Xu
and contributors (https://github.com/daviddmc/NeSVoR), under the MIT License.
Their license is retained in third_party/nesvor/LICENSE.
